# business-flows.mdc — Interview Architect

```yaml
businessFlows:
  - id: curriculum-discovery
    name: Browse structured curriculum
    description: A visitor browses the eight-module backend and system-design curriculum without requiring learner-state API availability.
    entryPoints:
      - GET /curriculum
      - apps/web/src/pages/CurriculumPage.tsx
    criticality: high

  - id: question-discovery
    name: Search and filter question bank
    description: A learner uses URL-backed search and module/topic/difficulty/format/status filters to find a suitable practice prompt.
    entryPoints:
      - GET /questions
      - apps/web/src/pages/QuestionBankPage.tsx
    criticality: high

  - id: timed-practice
    name: Complete a timed practice attempt
    description: A learner opens a question, starts or resumes an anonymous attempt, uses hints and answer guidance, self-scores rubric dimensions, and records completion.
    entryPoints:
      - GET /questions/:slug
      - POST /api/v1/attempts
      - PATCH /api/v1/attempts/:id
      - apps/web/src/pages/PracticePage.tsx
    criticality: high

  - id: learner-progress
    name: View progress and saved questions
    description: An anonymous learner loads aggregate progress, mastery, recent attempts, and bookmarks from the same-origin API.
    entryPoints:
      - GET /
      - GET /progress
      - GET /api/v1/progress
      - GET /api/v1/bookmarks
    criticality: high

  - id: adaptive-review
    name: Receive next study recommendation and review due work
    description: The deterministic coach and review queue use learner progress, prerequisites, available time, and recency to recommend the next question.
    entryPoints:
      - POST /api/v1/coach/next
      - GET /api/v1/review-queue
      - apps/web/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx
    criticality: medium

  - id: data-erasure
    name: Erase anonymous learner data
    description: A learner permanently deletes server-side anonymous progress and clears browser-owned learner storage and drafts.
    entryPoints:
      - DELETE /api/v1/me
      - apps/web/src/hooks/useLearner.tsx
      - apps/web/src/pages/PracticePage.tsx
    criticality: high
```
